    {
      "id": "588a668e371a-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "In a certain code language, 'LEGAL' is written as '37'. How will 'EAGLE' be written as in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &#39;LEGAL&#39; is written as &#39;37&#39;. How will &#39;EAGLE&#39; be written as in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "35",
          "html": "35"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "25",
          "html": "25"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "30",
          "html": "30"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p class=\"q-text\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 40, 41);\">L(12) E(5) G(7) A(1) L(12) = 12 + 5 + 7 + 1 + 12 = 37, </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"q-text\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><font color=\"#282829\">Similarly,</font> E(5) A(1) G(7) L(12) E(5) = 5 + 1 + 7 + 12 + 5 = 30.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "588a668e371a-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;SPIRIT&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;65&rsquo; and &lsquo;DENSE&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;83&rsquo;. How will &lsquo;LOGICAL&rsquo; be coded in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;SPIRIT&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;65&rsquo; and &lsquo;DENSE&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;83&rsquo;. How will &lsquo;LOGICAL&rsquo; be coded in that language?&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "213",
          "html": "213"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "231",
          "html": "231"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "123",
          "html": "123"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "132",
          "html": "132"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Logic: Sum of position value of reverse letters - number of letter in the word.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>In &#39;SPIRIT&#39;&nbsp;&rarr;</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F3_Madhuri_SSC_22.07.2022_D47.png\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 135px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Number of letter in&nbsp;&#39;SPIRIT&#39; = 6&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 71 - 6 = 65</p>\n\n<p>And&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">In </span><span style=\"\">&lsquo;DENSE&rsquo;</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&nbsp;&rarr;</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F3_Madhuri_SSC_22.07.2022_D48.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 135px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Number of letter in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&#39;DENSE&#39; = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 88&nbsp;- 5&nbsp;= 83</span></p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">In&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&lsquo;LOGICAL&rsquo;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&nbsp;&rarr;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage646f3b6e9c32e429c00b100a.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>Number of letter in &#39;LOGICAL&#39; = 7</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>&rArr; 130&nbsp;- 7&nbsp;= 123</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><b>Hence, the correct answer is &quot;123&quot;.</b></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F3_Madhuri_SSC_22.07.2022_D47.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/F3_Madhuri_SSC_22.07.2022_D48.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage646f3b6e9c32e429c00b100a.png"
