    {
      "id": "588a668e371a-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "In a certain code language, 'POM' is coded as '43', and 'HAN' is coded as '22'. How will 'BRO' be coded in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &#39;POM&#39; is coded as &#39;43&#39;, and &#39;HAN&#39; is coded as &#39;22&#39;. How will &#39;BRO&#39; be coded in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "33",
          "html": "33"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "35",
          "html": "35"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "34",
          "html": "34"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Logic:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sum of the Place Value -&nbsp;1</span>.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Now,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&#39;POM&#39; is coded as &#39;43&#39;,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;P(16) + O(15) + M(13)&nbsp;-&nbsp;1</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;16 + 15&nbsp;+ 13&nbsp;-&nbsp;1 = 43.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&#39;HAN&#39; is coded as &#39;22&#39;,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; H(8) + A(1) + N(14)&nbsp;-&nbsp;1</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; 8&nbsp;+ 1&nbsp;+ 14&nbsp;-&nbsp;1 = 22.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Similarly, for&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&#39;</span><span style=\"\">BRO</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&#39;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>&rArr; B(2) + R(18) + O(15)&nbsp;-&nbsp;1</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>&rArr; 2&nbsp;+ 18&nbsp;+ 15&nbsp;-&nbsp;1 = 34.</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">So,&nbsp;&#39;<span style=\"\">BRO</span>&#39;&nbsp;will be coded as &#39;34&#39;.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;34&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage8602.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
