    {
      "id": "588a668e371a-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "In a certain language &ldquo;FIVE&rdquo; can be coded as &ldquo;5940&rdquo;, then how will &ldquo;NINE&rdquo; be written in that code language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain language &ldquo;FIVE&rdquo; can be coded as &ldquo;5940&rdquo;, then how will &ldquo;NINE&rdquo; be written in that code language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8800",
          "html": "8800"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8820",
          "html": "8820"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "7980",
          "html": "7980"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8850",
          "html": "8850"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>According to the given coding language,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 150px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:67px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">F</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">I</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">V</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">E</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:67px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">9</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">22</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">5</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>6 × 9 × 22 × 5 = 5940</p>\n\n<p>Similarly for NINE,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 150px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:67px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">N</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">I</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">N</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">E</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:67px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">14</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">9</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:76px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">14</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:85px;height:18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">5</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>14 × 9 × 14 × 5 = 8820</p>\nHence, NINE is coded as <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">\"8820\"</span>.",
