    {
      "id": "588a668e371a-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "In a certain code language, 'ENJOY' is coded as '25' and 'DOCTOR' is coded as '36'. How will 'MILLION' be coded in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &#39;ENJOY&#39; is coded as &#39;25&#39; and &#39;DOCTOR&#39; is coded as &#39;36&#39;. How will &#39;MILLION&#39; be coded in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "39",
          "html": "39"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "49",
          "html": "49"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "51",
          "html": "51"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "64",
          "html": "64"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The logic&nbsp;followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage101.png\" style=\"height: 122px; width: 450px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong>Logic: (Addition of the number&nbsp;of letters)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;=&nbsp; Code</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&#39;ENJOY&#39; is coded as &#39;25&#39;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; There are 5 letters in the word&nbsp; &#39;ENJOY&#39;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; (5)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 25</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">And,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&#39;DOCTOR&#39; is coded as &#39;36&#39;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; There are 6 letters in the word = &#39;DOCTOR&#39;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; (6)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 36</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Similarly,</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&#39;MILLION&#39; is coded as &#39;?&#39;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; There are 7 letters in the word = &#39;MILLION&#39;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; (7)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 49</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;</strong><strong>49&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage101.png"
      ],
