      "solution": "<p>According to the English Alphabet series and its positional value;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>CHAIR &rarr; (3 + 8 + 1 +9 + 18) = 39 &rarr; (9 &ndash; 3) = 6</p>\n\n<p>JAR&nbsp;&rarr; (10 + 1 + 18) = 29&nbsp;&rarr; (9 &ndash; 2) = 7</p>\n\n<p><strong>BULB </strong>&rarr;&nbsp;<strong>(2 + 21 + 12 + 2) = 37&nbsp;</strong>&rarr;<strong>&nbsp;(7 &ndash; 3) = 4</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>4</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
